  genuine multi-tab write contention, which isn't this app. Taking A now doesn't foreclose B — the registry makes the
  on-disk layout an implementation detail behind a stable [38;5;153mget[39m/[38;5;153mset[39m API.

  Does that read right before I go into the design sections?

